{
  "asOf": "2026-10-01",
  "unit": "USD per million tokens",
  "note": "Plausible list prices by model class, filled in by hand from vendor pricing pages at the asOf date. Prices change often: verify against your provider before trusting an estimate. The CLI prints estimates for budgeting only; it never bills anything. Unknown models fall back to the `generic` row.",
